{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "da937b67-4e24-5b2d-b5dc-03dc44168c3f", "source_ordinal": 2141, "reading_ordinal": 1915, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "真雄心", "published_at": "2023-07-04T05:03:01+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/610072848/answer/3102447409"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "很遗憾的说，几乎不会带来什么影响，因为这只是一个玩具。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 27}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "要在ai发展的路线上有所实质进展，团队核心人物要下的功夫不是在算法上，而是在认知哲学、科学哲学上。", "char_start": 28, "char_end": 77}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "仅仅熟知算法，得到的也将仅仅是某种“高级套用”，或者稍好一点——一种类似爱迪生试灯丝似的“要素排列碰撞”。", "char_start": 78, "char_end": 131}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "即将各种主要因素排列组合出各种方案、先把“模型”训练出来，然后搞出某个指标来“比赛”，通过某种统计技巧，揪出一种特殊的优秀项目，然后发一篇论文，称其为“特定领域的成果”。", "char_start": 132, "char_end": 217}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "然后拿着这样的论文，老师评职称、学生找工作或者投名校。", "char_start": 218, "char_end": 245}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这只是一种庸俗的学术，一种浪费学术青春的傻事。", "char_start": 246, "char_end": 269}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "形如前天莫奈画出了《日出》，报纸上出现了大面积的好评，于是美院的学生们开始拿同样的笔法画《日落》、《月出》、《日食》……一样。", "char_start": 270, "char_end": 333}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "By the end of the day, all you have is the same difference.", "char_start": 334, "char_end": 393}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "不要把这话看成一种“打击”、“污蔑”，这是在告诉你不要在无意义的虚荣上徒耗精力，而要把目光放在真正会让你青史留名的事物上。", "char_start": 394, "char_end": 455}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "我素常最忧虑的，其实不是中国的年轻人没有能力、没有条件，而是中国的年轻人缺乏雄心。", "char_start": 456, "char_end": 497}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "真正的雄心。", "char_start": 498, "char_end": 504}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "AMBITION.", "char_start": 505, "char_end": 514}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "Not desire, not intention, but AMBITION.", "char_start": 515, "char_end": 555}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "那种改变人类命运、影响人类历史的野心。", "char_start": 556, "char_end": 575}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "现在这种真正狂妄的——或者更不避讳的说——伟大的野心在中国青年身上相当罕见。", "char_start": 576, "char_end": 614}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "我所看到的，往往全是些“阶层跃升”、“小目标”之类的以“要现实”为名、以怯懦和从众为名的软弱，取代真正的野心概念的，往往实际上只是对“小目标”惊人的羡慕和贪婪。", "char_start": 615, "char_end": 695}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这种对世俗欲望的羡慕和贪婪和对真正雄心的矢志不渝的追求所造成的动力学是极其不同的。", "char_start": 696, "char_end": 737}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "前者总是在焦虑的逼迫你做无效的事，在屡屡失败受挫后往往会导致你做越理非法、乃至虚假的愚行。它总是导致你该换赛道、追逐虚荣和贵人的认可，最终在无数堆干草中耗尽有限的生命。", "char_start": 738, "char_end": 822}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "后者则因为具有不朽的历史价值，只要哪怕任何一丁点经得起历史考验的成就就足以令你一生不至枉费，所以总在激励你不慌不忙的去做正确的事。它消解寂寞、总是击退焦虑，让你能长期曲折然而坚定的维持方向。", "char_start": 823, "char_end": 918}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "为什么这里要讲这样的“大道理”？", "char_start": 919, "char_end": 935}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "因为现在这个学术选择就体现出了这两种策略的差异。", "char_start": 936, "char_end": 960}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你真的想在ai领域做出值得历史记录一笔的贡献，你现在应该在意的是哲学类的领域。要先在哲学领域有所领悟，再去考虑实现问题、测试问题。", "char_start": 961, "char_end": 1026}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "那是真正的进展，真正开创性的工作。不要把时间首先花在赶学术时髦上——这种时髦是赶不完的，而你的人生有限。", "char_start": 1027, "char_end": 1079}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这话当然劝不住九成九的人，因为这群劝不住的九成九的人里面大约有一成左右可以从这种赶时髦中获得“好简历”、“好学位”，对ta们而言，能混到一个“好职位”、“好资历”，已经构成了充分的驱动力了。", "char_start": 1080, "char_end": 1175}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "但是请相信，剩下那1%的人的人生体验和这九成九的人有大不同。", "char_start": 1176, "char_end": 1206}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "要有雄心，要有真实的、而非cosplay的雄心。", "char_start": 1207, "char_end": 1231}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "不是你成就理想，而是理想会成就你。", "char_start": 1232, "char_end": 1249}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 27}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0287"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：北大团队发布法律大模型 ChatLaw，为大众提供普惠法律服务，将带来哪些影响？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027"], "summary": "围绕“真雄心”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“很遗憾的说，几乎不会带来什么影响，因为这只是一个玩具。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "很遗憾的说，几乎不会带来什么影响，因为这只是一个玩具。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 27, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "f6b95884-9b2d-5e20-9b88-23c0719bccc0", "source_ordinal": 2140, "reading_ordinal": 1916, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "百发百中", "published_at": "2023-07-05T04:36:34+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/32059030/answer/3104020622"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "奥运射箭冠军为什么总是击中靶心？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这其实并不全是因为ta们的姿势稳固、肌肉强劲、动作协调。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 45}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "而在于ta们在站位、举弓、开弓、靠位这些发射前过程中对自身的动作完成质量、环境变化的观察有足够的敏感性和准确性。", "char_start": 46, "char_end": 102}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "在没有撒放之前，就知道这一箭我左肩前推不够坚决、我头部姿态偏向后仰、我整体重心过于偏向内侧……", "char_start": 103, "char_end": 150}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "于是ta们把没把握的发射放弃了。", "char_start": 151, "char_end": 167}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "“百战百胜”的首要保证，不是战无不胜，而是不打无把握之仗。", "char_start": 168, "char_end": 197}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 6}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0287"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么腾讯在南山区法院老是赢？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006"], "summary": "围绕“百发百中”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“奥运射箭冠军为什么总是击中靶心？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "奥运射箭冠军为什么总是击中靶心？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e87545d0-6dca-551a-add4-1891bcd09330", "source_ordinal": 2139, "reading_ordinal": 1917, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "立正", "published_at": "2023-07-05T20:52:08+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/610370583/answer/3105233745"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "信息太少，没什么可看。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不过要做事要拿起法律武器，不要拿起舆论武器。", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 34}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "现在看上去这个退学是指当事人自己自愿退学，那就没什么可谈的了。你如果真不服，不妨坚持立场不申请退学，等着学校给你行政处分。", "char_start": 35, "char_end": 96}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "有行政处分的文件，那么你就可以依法质疑学校拟定的事由，要求学校提供这样处罚的依据。这个处置如果是勉强的，那么它的依据必然也不堪一击，到时候学校的舆论危机自然有凭有据的越闹越大，甚至把校长书记折腾下台也有可能。但是你如果顶不住各种压力，自己走了“自愿申请退学”这条路，那就没什么好说的了。", "char_start": 97, "char_end": 240}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这样在程序正义的角度讲就没什么可帮你的了。至于外界各种社会经验不足的人的“义愤填膺”，以及以阴阳怪气评论这类形式给你的“声援”，只不过顶多热闹两天就会自然烟消云散，几乎毫无实际意义。", "char_start": 241, "char_end": 332}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "要想斗争，那就要坚守斗争的觉悟。随你怎么逼我，不该签的东西我不签。你要伤我、杀我，那你别指望吓唬我然后我自伤、自杀，你得自己找杀手来伤、来杀。你要徇私枉法冤枉我，那由得你，那就请你办好所有手续，别指望我自己写认罪书。你要严刑逼供，那就请你动手，我如果挺不住，自有人让你的人脱不了身；我挺住了，那你们自然也别想跑掉。", "char_start": 333, "char_end": 490}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "简单来说，你要害我，你就必须做完全部加害的动作，不要指望我因为屈服于你的恐吓来自我伤害，帮你免了麻烦。", "char_start": 491, "char_end": 542}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "我要提醒你——如果你派的杀手被我抓住、你做手脚的文件被我察觉，那么你就做好承担后果的心理准备。", "char_start": 543, "char_end": 590}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "我这些话既然当你面说出来了，你就应该想到我每天都吃饱睡足、穿着防弹衣、开着行车记录仪和云录音。你最好不要有加害还能完全逃脱的侥幸，你要先准备好你请的杀手把你供出来的可能性，你的文件、手续被复核的准备。", "char_start": 591, "char_end": 691}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你觉得你有把握搏一搏，我没立场不让你试，那就大家各安天命，看你会不会得不偿失。", "char_start": 692, "char_end": 731}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你想要主持正义，这是你提前就要有的觉悟，不然你基本上最后肯定会屈服，而且常常会以写自白书认罪的方式屈服。", "char_start": 732, "char_end": 784}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "不要喊“凭什么正义这么难”——正义从古到今一直这么难，真正的问题是你为什么会认为它没这么难。", "char_start": 785, "char_end": 831}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 12}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0287"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待北京政法职业学院李敬言疑似退学？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "围绕“立正”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“信息太少，没什么可看。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "信息太少，没什么可看。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "96003b50-e514-5b9e-a1c7-56277ba2ba1b", "source_ordinal": 2138, "reading_ordinal": 1918, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "开朗的抑郁", "published_at": "2023-07-06T14:55:42+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/610557808/answer/3106293668"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "实际上“看起来开朗自信”本身就常常是抑郁症的征兆。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "因为外人对抑郁症干预的严重不专业，一旦流露出忧郁、消极，就容易招来大量粗糙的、帮倒忙的“关心”、“安慰”。", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 79}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这些“关心”、“安慰”，常常让抑郁患者敏锐的觉察到发起者往往抱着“缴费买平安”的交易心态，一旦自己“关心”、“安慰”了，被“关心”“安慰”的人却不见好转，发起者会下意识的认为自己付出了成本却没收到“货”，会以一种斥责卖假货、贪污的心态来攻击被“关心”、“安慰”的对象，最后的结果往往是关系的恶化或消耗。", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 231}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "算一算，得不偿失。而且是批量的、大面积的得不偿失。其净结果反而是极速的败坏了自己的社会关系和社交环境，对自己的处境只有严重的恶化而不是好转。", "char_start": 232, "char_end": 302}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "换言之，一个人一旦陷入抑郁，就会在很短的时间内从若干实实在在的教训中学到最好不要随便流露。", "char_start": 303, "char_end": 348}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "否则朋友只要看见，甚至只是敏感的察觉，就会见一个少一个。", "char_start": 349, "char_end": 377}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "注意看——很多朋友会把“敏感的觉察对方的负面情绪并迅速作出反应”视为“朋友之道”的基本内容和经典实践。毕竟自己也被“连我这么难过都看不出来，算什么朋友”这样的斥责“教育”过了，不是吗？", "char_start": 378, "char_end": 470}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "于是这就导致抑郁患者只好连“被敏感的察觉”的可能性都要堵死——结果就是密不透风的、无懈可击的“开朗”“自信”。", "char_start": 471, "char_end": 526}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "于是这造成了一个诡异的结果——恰恰因为是抑郁的，所以必须是“开朗”的。", "char_start": 527, "char_end": 562}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 9}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0287"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么李玟明明看起来那么开朗自信，却罹患抑郁症？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009"], "summary": "围绕“开朗的抑郁”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“实际上“看起来开朗自信”本身就常常是抑郁症的征兆。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "实际上“看起来开朗自信”本身就常常是抑郁症的征兆。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a2105975-029d-5216-9d57-6d0e99d86730", "source_ordinal": 2137, "reading_ordinal": 1919, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "先民特权", "published_at": "2023-07-06T16:24:44+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/605341693/answer/3106449162"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "就算要经过你同意，那要如何操作？没有可操作性的主张是没有意义的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "并非别人的一切权利都要来自你的授予，这是有例外的。", "char_start": 33, "char_end": 58}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "历史的先到者有一些特权——ta们可以决定后来者要面对的历史现实。", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 91}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你的出生与否就是这种“先民特权”的一种体现。", "char_start": 92, "char_end": 114}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "除此之外，在公，ta们还决定了你要面对的法律体系、社会现状甚至国家边界；在私，ta们决定了你的家乡、校友和家庭环境。", "char_start": 115, "char_end": 173}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "权柄天授，不受妄议。", "char_start": 174, "char_end": 184}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你对你之后的人也有这特权，不给你，你又怎么活呢？", "char_start": 185, "char_end": 209}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 7}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0287"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：“你生孩子，经过孩子同意了吗？”怎么回答？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007"], "summary": "围绕“先民特权”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“就算要经过你同意，那要如何操作？没有可操作性的主张是没有意义的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "就算要经过你同意，那要如何操作？没有可操作性的主张是没有意义的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "867be15b-0a0c-50e8-aa02-4a3bf3ac3625", "source_ordinal": 2136, "reading_ordinal": 1920, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "人力情报验证", "published_at": "2023-07-06T21:26:31+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/609620166/answer/3106845137"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "我们的情报人员要注意观察一下美军亚太部署的海空军部队的待遇条件是不是有明显提高。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "和平时期，外军对我军的实力认知最可靠的指标就是外军心理疾患的发病率和招募待遇的提高。", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "而这个指标是非常容易验证的，成本低廉、效用分明。", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 108}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "例如，台湾的志愿兵短缺问题的迅速恶化就是对我们的军事改革效果最好的印证，藏不住、瞒不了。", "char_start": 109, "char_end": 153}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这个由不得政客、将领们嘴硬。", "char_start": 154, "char_end": 168}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 5}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0287"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待搭载WS-15的歼-20成功试飞？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005"], "summary": "围绕“人力情报验证”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“我们的情报人员要注意观察一下美军亚太部署的海空军部队的待遇条件是不是有明显提高。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "我们的情报人员要注意观察一下美军亚太部署的海空军部队的待遇条件是不是有明显提高。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 40, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "70ea33ba-14c0-5ecb-9f85-617919f95d35", "source_ordinal": 2135, "reading_ordinal": 1921, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "食人崇拜", "published_at": "2023-07-08T02:36:48+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/59546340/answer/3108686028"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "说来比较无语，从人类历史的普遍事实来看，“吃人”和“受崇拜”是存在高相关性的两个特性。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 43}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "道理非常简单，捕食关系是在原始条件下最容易注意到和被理解的权力关系，是最原始的、不必依赖于语言、文字就足以自然成立的直觉概念。人类很早就发现了食物链的等级现象。捕食者相对于被捕食的对象存在着显而易见的优越性，显然的拥有主动造成对方死亡的自由。更显然的是——即使狮子病了、伤了，也不会见到羚羊去主动进攻狮子。", "char_start": 44, "char_end": 197}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "人类是先知道这个规律，然后才开始产生其他需要依赖文字和语言的文化的。", "char_start": 198, "char_end": 232}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "那么很自然的，任何高于人的事物，都逻辑必然的拥有夺取人的生命的能力，而这其中，“以人为食”更是确凿无疑的典型证明。", "char_start": 233, "char_end": 290}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "如果“崇拜”是最简单的下位者与上位者之间的关系，那么“崇拜以人为食的事物”就成了顺理成章的思维定势。", "char_start": 291, "char_end": 341}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "所以这种崇拜心理并不是什么很让人意外的现象。", "char_start": 342, "char_end": 364}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 6}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0287"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么汉尼拔杀人吃人还有人崇拜？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006"], "summary": "围绕“食人崇拜”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“说来比较无语，从人类历史的普遍事实来看，“吃人”和“受崇拜”是存在高相关性的两个特性。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "说来比较无语，从人类历史的普遍事实来看，“吃人”和“受崇拜”是存在高相关性的两个特性。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 43, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "92f3ef1e-60e1-58af-9a37-58331fa648be", "source_ordinal": 2134, "reading_ordinal": 1922, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "克里希那穆提", "published_at": "2023-07-08T03:55:06+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/28921457/answer/3108705347"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "我是反对用诗性的语言来谈论伦理问题的，更反对将伦理问题看成“灵性问题”“身心灵问题”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 43}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "使用诗性的语言，可以巧妙的为解读者留下足够的自定义空间，让每一个读者都通过自己补足下半部红楼，去“合著”出一个自己“完全赞同”的版本出来。一旦构成这种“合著关系”，读者自己就转换成了作者之一 ——于是，哪有第二作者痛批第一作者的道理？结果自然总是赞不绝口了。", "char_start": 44, "char_end": 173}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "表面上赞的是克氏，实际上赞的是自己的“合著”，赞的是“续了红楼”的自己。", "char_start": 174, "char_end": 210}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你们要珍惜那些把话说得土土的、举例丰富、比喻形象、不回避清晰定义和定性、定量讨论的人，那些会把图纸画出来、把逻辑路线列出来、把案例讲出来的人。要避开这类话说一半、一句话里未定义的神秘概念占到一半篇幅的人。", "char_start": 211, "char_end": 313}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "要回避神秘和玄奥。要注意分辨深奥和玄奥的区别。你看不懂的理论物理、高等数学，那是深奥，那是可以懂的，你只是现在功夫没有到这一步，那是已知可知的未知罢了。", "char_start": 314, "char_end": 390}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "克氏的东西就属于玄奥这一类。玄奥类的理论，总是要依赖这个“合著效应”来获得对其合理性的附和，它在本质上是不可讨论的。因为它的高度易附和性，它很容易造就这类圣贤传说。但是它对你的实际作用很小，因为你从中“领悟”的东西，本质上只是套用了另一套话术的自己的价值观和世界观，你其实还是在走你自己的老路，只是有了一种“全新感”。", "char_start": 391, "char_end": 550}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "那是假象，时间久了你自己总会知道的。", "char_start": 551, "char_end": 569}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "不要作诗，不要用诗性的语言讨论实践操作的事。说话做事要确切、踏实、具体。要多亲近这样的人。", "char_start": 570, "char_end": 615}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "另外，我很清楚有人觉得我像克里希那穆提。那多半是因为我的内容经常给人带来同样的减轻焦虑的感受。但是实际上我和他遵循的是完全不同的方法论，主张的观点也大不相同。", "char_start": 616, "char_end": 695}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "我是一个凡人，坚持主张说话做事要老老实实、朴朴素素、down to earth。", "char_start": 696, "char_end": 736}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "我不是一个圣贤，或者先知，或者佛的转世、神的化身，而且也绝不赞同或者追求让人这样来看待我。", "char_start": 737, "char_end": 782}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "我所做的不是什么“前无古人后无来者”的“只能仰视”的神迹，而是你们都可以做到的，而且做了比不做对你本人更有实在帮助、所以你本就该做的事。你们只是缺少足够的参考、缺少足够的知晓，所以不知道这么做有好处、有多大好处以及从哪里入手、具体如何做罢了。", "char_start": 783, "char_end": 904}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这都是非常朴素的话题，都是些“被人误解怎么办”“借东西不还该怎么办”这类的具体问题，给出的答案也都是尽可能具体的系统方法。", "char_start": 905, "char_end": 966}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "不要迷恋神秘，踏实一点。", "char_start": 967, "char_end": 979}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "土土的，好养活。", "char_start": 980, "char_end": 988}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0287"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何客观地评价克里希那穆提？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“克里希那穆提”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“我是反对用诗性的语言来谈论伦理问题的，更反对将伦理问题看成“灵性问题”“身心灵问题”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "我是反对用诗性的语言来谈论伦理问题的，更反对将伦理问题看成“灵性问题”“身心灵问题”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 43, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
